{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/f69ff166afb623a858b05682e96df2ae.avif?t=1758680931\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a new world full of action thanks to the new war vehicles designed to be fast and destructive. Use the abilities of your HoverTank, be agile and destroy to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/5889a21d418ad2f91ad8840c1c2d5d28.avif?t=1758680931\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your opponent in different situations. Team battles, Deathmatch, Capture the Flag, Dominations, Tournaments and much more! Learn from your HoverTank's moves and attacks and rise to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/3edf265774742f5abf66b947ce97186c.avif?t=1758680931\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends and the world on different planets. Search for the mysterious power of the crystal &quot;Etherlium&quot;, and dominate your enemies thanks to the ultimate power of the crystal's energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and agile movements to defend your team from the explosions of other players, as well as from the artificial intelligence, which, it seems, has surprises to deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><